Welcome to the https://mgmtconfig.com/ workshop!

This machine is provided as a courtesy in a shared environment. Please don't
use your access to do crimes or to interfere with the host or other machines.

This is not a red teaming exercise. There are no expectations of privacy when
using this machine, so please act accordingly. Have fun and please share your
learnings with others!

Nothing in this machine is backed up, please make sure to save any files or
code that you care about on your personal devices.

Please start by changing the root password to something unique. You can do this
with the `passwd` command.

You can follow the examples in the workshop/ dir or choose your own adventure.

Thanks,
James
@purpleidea
